# Need to reference xp-flwidgets
#
# Revision 1.4  2001/10/01 13:47:02  dick
# Get rid of frags.  UndoableCommand supports undo and redo (these were
# separate before).
#
# Revision 1.3  2001/09/27 18:03:09  dick
# Add KbUndoableFrag to the makefiles
#
# Revision 1.2  2001/09/25 15:42:54  dick
# New files to the kbconfig library
#
